    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακογχῠλ-ιάζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόγχη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break open</i>
			the capsule covering the seal of a will, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθήκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					589
				</span></i>
			 (with <i>double entente</i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				51(27).9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγαργαρίζω</span>
			 (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατι</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				185d
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακογχυλίσαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
